  "title": "Blackened Grilled Sea Bass",
  "description": "Fire up the barbecue for this quick and easy blackened grilled sea bass recipe seasoned with dried thyme, paprika, black pepper, and cayenne pepper.",
  "authors": [
    "Frank LeGassick"
  ],
